      en: ["Cascata de São Nicolau is approximately 60 meters high.", "The hydroelectric plant was built in the early 20th century.", "The river is located within the Obo National Park.", "The source is in the central volcanic massif.", "Vital for irrigation in the Mé-Zóchi district.", "Home to endemic birds like the São Tomé weaver."],
